// Executable icon for the widget. Without this the exe carries no icon
// resource, so the taskbar, Alt-Tab, Start-menu shortcut and "Apps & features"
// entry all fall back to the generic Windows application icon.
//
// app.ico is the multi-size (16/24/32/48/64/128/256) conversion of
// assets/icon-win.png - the same artwork electron-builder turns into the
// Electron installer's icon. The NSIS script points at this one file too, so
// the installed product has a single icon source.
1 ICON "app.ico"
